1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,140
Water quality monitoring should do more
than display numbers.

2
00:00:03,785 --> 00:00:07,860
It should help operators detect problems
and respond before they escalate.

3
00:00:08,945 --> 00:00:10,700
Introducing DWMS.

4
00:00:11,285 --> 00:00:13,440
Sensor data, real-time visualization,

5
00:00:14,225 --> 00:00:17,000
and a traceable response workflow in one
platform.

6
00:00:17,845 --> 00:00:19,600
The hardware path supports pH,

7
00:00:20,265 --> 00:00:22,260
total dissolved solids, and turbidity.

8
00:00:22,825 --> 00:00:24,975
These demonstration readings are
simulated.

9
00:00:25,805 --> 00:00:30,060
Abnormal readings create alerts, showing
the affected parameter and condition.

10
00:00:31,065 --> 00:00:36,030
DWMS connects detection with action,
requesting a response through predefined

11
00:00:36,045 --> 00:00:37,080
operating rules.

12
00:00:37,745 --> 00:00:39,500
This pump activity is a simulation.

13
00:00:40,245 --> 00:00:42,045
No physical equipment is controlled.

14
00:00:42,465 --> 00:00:46,590
Critical conditions latch emergency mode,
request a stop, and prevent

15
00:00:46,605 --> 00:00:47,720
automatic restart.

16
00:00:48,505 --> 00:00:51,380
Returning readings alone cannot clear the
interlock.

17
00:00:51,805 --> 00:00:53,420
Recovery requires an operator.

18
00:00:54,265 --> 00:00:58,590
Once readings recover, the operator
confirms recovery, allowing a controlled

19
00:00:58,605 --> 00:01:01,920
return to normal operation and recording
the transition.

20
00:01:02,525 --> 00:01:06,650
Historical trends, device records, and
site grouping provide operational

21
00:01:06,665 --> 00:01:09,100
visibility across monitoring locations.

22
00:01:09,885 --> 00:01:13,020
The software integration is tested with
isolated fixtures.

23
00:01:13,745 --> 00:01:17,500
Ethm is designed to explain authorized
monitoring evidence.

24
00:01:18,185 --> 00:01:22,000
Live AI remains unavailable until provider
credit is restored.

25
00:01:22,685 --> 00:01:24,700
AI never controls equipment.

26
00:01:25,665 --> 00:01:29,700
DWMS, turning water data into accountable
decisions.

27
00:01:30,345 --> 00:01:32,620
Monitor, detect, respond.

28
00:01:33,485 --> 00:01:36,520
Ahmed Alzahrani, founder and project lead.
